{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35666","headline":"兵後寻边三首 三 · 李山甫","name":"兵後寻边三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风怒边沙迸铁衣，胡儿胡马正骄肥。\n将军对阵谁教入，战士辞营不道归。\n新血溅红黏蔓草，旧骸堆白映寒晖。\n胸中纵有销兵术，欲向何门说是非。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35666.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35666","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}